---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Digital Dental Surgery | Technology & Precision – DDX" lang="en" description="Discover how DDX's complete digital workflow — CBCT, intraoral scanner and guided surgery — enables minimally invasive treatments with accelerated recovery.">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <div class="page-hero" style="padding:32px 32px 24px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our technology</span>
    <h1 class="page-h1" style="font-size:2rem; margin-top:6px;">Digital Dental Surgery</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub" style="margin-top:10px; font-size:1rem; color:var(--text-muted); max-width:560px; margin-inline:auto;">Technology & Precision</p>
    <div class="divider-bar" style="margin:10px auto 0;"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <div class="sec-white">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="prose-block">
        <p class="lead" style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--charcoal);">
          Digital planning is not a luxury. It is what separates predictable dentistry from dentistry that improvises.
        </p>
        <p class="lead">
          At DDX Digital Dental Xperts we have built a 100% digital clinical workflow: from diagnosis with CBCT and intraoral scanner, to guided surgery with a printed surgical guide based on the virtual plan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BENEFITS -->
  <div class="sec-light">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="center" style="margin-bottom:44px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">The clinical benefit</span>
        <h2 class="sec-h2">What changes for the patient</h2>
        <div class="divider-bar"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap:28px;">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Minimal invasion</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">We only intervene on the necessary tissue, planned to the millimetre in advance. No unnecessary cuts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Accelerated recovery</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">Without over-intervention, the post-operative period is drastically reduced. Our patients return to normal life in days, not weeks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">✅</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Predictable rehabilitation</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">The patient knows from the outset what to expect and when. No surprises, no plan changes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🗓️</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Compressed timelines</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">A case that would take 6–9 months in a conventional clinic is resolved in a fraction of the time with our protocol.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🔬</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Complete 3D diagnosis</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">CBCT + intraoral scanner + Exoplan® software. We see the bone, the nerves and the exact space before operating.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="value-title">Guided surgery</h3>
          <p class="value-desc">A surgical guide printed from the virtual plan. The surgery follows the exact map designed in 3D. Maximum safety and precision.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FLOW -->
  <div class="sec-white">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="center" style="margin-bottom:44px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our protocol</span>
        <h2 class="sec-h2">The complete digital workflow</h2>
        <div class="divider-bar"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-block">
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li><strong>Intraoral scanner:</strong> precise digital capture of the patient's dental and gingival anatomy.</li>
          <li><strong>CBCT (3D):</strong> three-dimensional image of the bone, nerves and critical anatomical structures.</li>
          <li><strong>Planning with Exocad® / Exoplan®:</strong> virtual design of the complete treatment, including exact position of implants and prostheses.</li>
          <li><strong>Printed surgical guide:</strong> physical guide obtained from the virtual plan that directs the surgery with complete precision.</li>
          <li><strong>Minimally invasive surgery:</strong> controlled, fast and predictable intervention based on the digital plan.</li>
          <li><strong>Digital prosthesis:</strong> fabrication of the definitive restoration with CAD/CAM technology for maximum precision and aesthetics.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cta-banner">
    <div class="cta-banner-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow-dark">Take the first step</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h2-white">Want to know what we can do for your case?</h2>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/en/appointment" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Book an appointment</a>
        <a href="/en/about" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">About us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
